    "detailed_description": "Classic survival horror focused on puzzle solving, exploration and strategy.<br>Part II of 'Injection \u03c023' trilogy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492650/extras/c91c10e0141e17bfb2103c4aad5b6204.poster.avif?t=1705277028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492650/extras/c91c10e0141e17bfb2103c4aad5b6204.webm?t=1705277028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492650/extras/c91c10e0141e17bfb2103c4aad5b6204.mp4?t=1705277028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take control of a lonely and isolated person who is looking for his lost dog and finds himself involved in a dark conspiracy.<br><br>Cryptic story about conspiracies, mind control and the human condition. Story inspired by real and historical events<br>Three different endings.<br>Lots of collectibles and secrets.<br>Extra game modes and unlockable features.<br>Scenario based on a real town in Malaga-Andaluc\u00eda-Spain<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492650/extras/da175cf486a6d81c768379278592b762.poster.avif?t=1705277028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492650/extras/da175cf486a6d81c768379278592b762.webm?t=1705277028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492650/extras/da175cf486a6d81c768379278592b762.mp4?t=1705277028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>interchangeable views at any time:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Third person (free and autocam)<br></li><li>First person<br></li><li>Classic cameras/fixed angles (modern control or 'tank control')</li></ul>",
